  "display_title": "Swept Up By the Wind Spirit",
  "description": "After being reborn as a weak wind spirit destined to be killed in the battle against cursed beings, Asella had only one goal: survive! But her plans go awry when she forms a pact with Captain Lassez Siertensia, the man who will cause her death. Desperate to change her fate, Asella tries to find a way to break the pact quietly, only to attract the unwanted attention of four other men who take an interest in her. Will Asella find a way to overcome her misfortune without being swept off her feet? \n\n(Source: Tapas)",
